1 REM FBCS GFX-0122
2 REM CLAIM D-13.2-4
3 REM TYPE SELF
100 PRINT "GFX-0122 NO POINT STYLE BEYOND 5: SET 6 RAISES 11056 (Ap C 13.2)"
